{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1552230-pretty-prancing-ponies-\ud83d\udc0e","id":1552230,"title":"Pretty Prancing Ponies \ud83d\udc0e","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-07-09T06:18:28-07:00","id":1552230,"title":"Pretty Prancing Ponies \ud83d\udc0e","content":"Does anyone out there know anything about horseback riding? I'm trying to come up with stats for high, average, and poor quality horses but I don't know the first thing about them. How many &quot;grades&quot; of horses are there, and would the differences be great enough to warrant different stats?<br /> <br /> Some insight into the actual mechanics of horseback riding, jumping, dressage, and their use in combat or police actions would also be helpful. How is riding sidesaddle mechanically different from riding astride, or bareback for that matter? What about leaping from one mount to your spare mid-stride, how would you handle that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/856697-motor-city-breakdown-a-playable-changeling-setting-for-detroit-michigan\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/19D2lK7otRprpHsJz0aZF0WucpMtoEgGQ2ExZJ-ud0a4/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">Devil's Night in the D</a>, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFgCI8m4gJ5kg1DneG0Cgu18bmUpe4RxDNDfI824G6M/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">The Magical History Tour</a><br /> Accuracy Consultant on <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/AshesOfTheMotorCity.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Ashes of the Motor City</a><br /> Editor, Compiler, and Senior Contributor to <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OxlnZCafIZtgPMCfikl0DJvWAwZKJDLk6lxh9hF